            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The frailty of elderly people with diabetes requires various factors to be taken into account including lifestyle, the moment of the diagnosis, the patient's experience, the social context including any financial difficulties. It is thereby apparent that the support requirements differ depending on the situations. Medical telemonitoring can be an appropriate solution.</AbstractText>
